DOMAIN: Historical Materialism and Theology
SEARCH_DATE: 2026-06-10
PAPERS_FOUND: 14 total (High: 6, Medium: 5, Low: 3)
SEARCH_SOURCES: SEP, PhilPapers, Semantic Scholar, OpenAlex, CORE (rate-limited), CrossRef
